<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A relationship between a quality and a portion of reality such that the quality refers to or is cognitively directed towards the portion of reality."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "person: William Hogan"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1515/regular10.pdf" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <https://github.com/information-artifact-ontology/IAO/issues/285> .
