<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In the definition source, the relation is called 'is_about'. To avoid confusion with the existing \"is about\" relation in IAO, we called it 'is directed towards' per Alan Ruttenberg's suggestion."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is directed towards"@en .
