<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> """information_content_entity 'is_encoded_in' some digital_entity in obi before split (040907). information_content_entity 'is_encoded_in' some physical_document in obi before split (040907).

Previous. An information content entity is a non-realizable information entity that 'is encoded in' some digital or physical entity."""@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "2014-03-10: The use of \"thing\" is intended to be general enough to include universals and configurations (see https://groups.google.com/d/msg/information-ontology/GBxvYZCk1oc/-L6B5fSBBTQJ)."@en .
