<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A software interpreter is a software application that executes some specified input software."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Do we care? Jennifer: Yes, there was a particular version of R that had a bug and it was fixed later. That would imply that we mean specific version of an interpreter. So an instance of this would be a particular version of the interpreter"@en .
