<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000574> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "A new pubmed ID being created for a journal article, and the associated pubmed record containing information to the journal article. A license plate number registered at the DMV to be belonging to a specific vehicle and owner. Placing a barcode on a product and entering information in a database that this barcode is assigned."@en .
