<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000638> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> """From Xiao et al. BMC Anesthesiol. 2013; 13: 33. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4016475/):

