<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Sonic Frequency that is between 2 and 4 kHz."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000006> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000007> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
