<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A First-Order Administrative Region that is part of a Country and delimits the authority of a magistrate who holds constitutionally-defined administrative jurisdiction over the defined geographic territory that bounds the Province."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000046> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Province&oldid=1062496131"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000046> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000051> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000051> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Construction"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000051> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000908> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Material Artifact Processing wherein Material Artifacts are built on site as prescribed by some contract."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "An Act of Construction typically involves the production of only one or a limited number of goods, such as in the construction of an airport or a community of condominiums."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000051> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
