<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Bodily Component that consists of a portion of hair that grows on the scalp of a human or other animal."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000058> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
