<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Act of Instant Messaging"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Communication Mediated by Artifact in which real-time direct text-based communication occurs between two or more Agents using personal computers or other devices, along with shared Instant Messaging Client Software conveyed over a computer network."@en .
