<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Realizable Entity of an Independent Continuant that creates an opportunity for an Agent to realize some Agent Capability or Disposition in some Act."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000177> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "J. J. Gibson, \"The Theory of Affordances,\" in The Ecological Approach to Visual Perception (NY: Taylor & Francis Group, 1986): 127-143. Available at: https://archive.org/details/pdfy-u5hmFOvOM2Civ4Gz/page/n70/mode/1up."@en .
