<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000179> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000570> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Force that is equal in magnitude to but in the opposite direction of an exerted Force and which is used to describe the forward Force of a Jet or Rocket Engine in reaction to the Acceleration of its Reaction Mass in the opposite direction."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "More generally, Thrust is the propulsive Force of a Rocket."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000179> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
