<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000354> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000356> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000356> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Publishing Mass Media Article"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000356> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00002077> .
