<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000357> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Planned Act by which an Agent causes the position or location of some Object to change."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000357> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/motion" .
