<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000389> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Buying"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000389> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001334> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Purchasing wherein a Financial Instrument is used by an Agent (the Buyer) to acquire ownership of a good from another Agent (the Seller)."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000389> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
