<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Electromagnetic Radiation Frequency of some Electromagnetic Wave that is between 300 GHz and 3 THz."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The corresponding Wavelength range is 1–0.1 mm"@en .
