<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Gain of Dependent Continuant in which some Independent Continuant becomes the bearer of some Specifically Dependent Continuant."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A Person becomes pregnant (gain of quality), A person becomes forgetful (gain of disposition), A vehicle becomes amphibious (gain of function), A Person becomes a Database Administrator (gain of role)." .
