<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Artifact Employment in which some Agent uses some Vehicle."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000515> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
