<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Microwave Frequency that is between 30 and 300 GHz."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The corresponding Wavelength range is 10–1 mm"@en .
