<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Gain of Specifically Dependent Continuant in which some Independent Continuant becomes the bearer of some Realizable Entity."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An informant becomes unreliable (disposition), A person begins to speak French (function), a person becomes a welder (role)." .
