<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "ID"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Identifier"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Designative Information Content Entity that consists of a string of characters that designates an entity within a specified namespace or context, is not a Designative Name, may be automatically or randomly generated, and typically has no preexisting cultural or social significance."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000649> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
