<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Convention on Rights and Duties of States (inter-American); December 26, 1933. https://avalon.law.yale.edu/20th_century/intam03.asp. Accessed 6 Apr. 2023." .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2023-02-06T10:14:09-05:00"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material Territory of a Government Domain"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001341> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> _:g180e767d7e_cb14b1328433960f3ef60464bd2162cab8fef671991bcc4904f46e5066c60a8d9c6 .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The portions of lithosphere, hydrosphere, or atmosphere that together exactly occupy a Government Domain."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Material Territory of a Government Domain"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000662> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://avalon.law.yale.edu/20th_century/intam03.asp" .
