<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Radio Frequency that is between 30 and 300 Hz."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The corresponding Wavelength range is 10,000–1,000 km"@en .
