<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Alex, Bob, Cathy" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\"Familiar form of a Proper Name\" means: that the name is (originally) a short, affectionate version of the fuller name, used (originally) by family or friends."@en .
