<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000830> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Speed"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000830> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000144> .
