<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Process Profile that is characterized by the magnitude of an object's motion with respect to a frame of reference during some time period."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "An object's speed is the scalar absolute value of it's Velocity."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000830> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Speed&oldid=1058949945"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
