<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000833> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:ga973a0f982_cb2d247fcd24657851bd57a3784b500c7f35ecdc8a882248435963d54a76b1682a6 .
