<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Decimal Time of Day Identifier that designates a Julian Date and is composed of both a Julian Day Number and a Julian Date Fraction."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000833> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000834> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000834> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mid Infrared Light Frequency"@en .
