<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000836> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Financial Instrument Use"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000836> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000566> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Artifact Employment in which some Agent uses some Financial Instrument."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000836> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000837> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000837> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Family"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000837> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000914> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000837> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Group of Persons related to one another by ancestry or marriage."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000837> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000839> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
