<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000850> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stasis of Quality"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000850> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000135> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Stasis of Specifically Dependent Continuant in which some Independent Continuant bears some Quality that remains unchanged during a Temporal Interval."@en .
