<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000855> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:g58aa837805_cb29680e1cef3b61702cce98e1b3e7d2209f9c4c244ae4ee9a3547c6d3926652b48 .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Effect caused by some Act of Location Change and which results in an Object being located in a different place."@en .
