<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Representative Communication in which a person makes an admission of misdeeds or faults."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000863> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000865> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000865> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Loss of Specifically Dependent Continuant"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000865> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000876> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Loss of Dependent Continuant in which some Independent Continuant ceases to be the bearer of some Specifically Dependent Continuant."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000865> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000866> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000866> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Radio Broadcast"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000866> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00002076> .
