<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000876> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000004> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Change in which some Independent Continuant ceases to be the bearer or carrier of some Dependent Continuant."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000876> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000879> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000879> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Religious Group Affiliation"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000879> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000433> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Association wherein some Person belongs to some Religious Demonination or sub-Denomination."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000879> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000883> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000883> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Inviting"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000883> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001162> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Commissive Communication performed by requesting the presence or participation of the audience, and which may include offering an incentive or inducement."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000883> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/invite" .
