<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Loaning"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000836> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Financial Instrument Use wherein a Financial Instrument is given by an Agent (the Creditor) to another Agent (the Debtor) in order to receive Repayments from the Debtor which are of greater Financial Value."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000884> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Loan&oldid=1063513958"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
