<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Local Administrative Region in which a relatively large human population permanently resides; is designated as a city based on a particular administrative, legal, or historical status; and which delimits a local Government that typically oversees the provision of systems for sanitation, utilities, land usage, housing, and transportation."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000887> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=City&oldid=1062635325"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
