<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Temporal Reference System that is designed to organize and identify dates."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Calendars typically organize dates through the use of naming and temporal conventions based on Days, Weeks, Months, and Years."@en .
