<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Stasis of Generically Dependent Continuant that consists of a socially, culturally, or ritually recognized union or legal contract between spouses that establishes rights and obligations between them, between them and their children, and between them and their in-laws."@en .
