<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ac Act of Communication intended to mislead the audience by distortion or falsification of evidence and induce a reaction that is prejudicial to the interests of the audience."@en .
