<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Role that inheres in an Agent by virtue of that Agent's responsibilities to operate or control some Material Artifact."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "the role of driving a car" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "the role of flying an airplane" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "the role of operating a crane" .
