<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001144> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Act of Entertainment"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001144> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Planned Act consisting of any activity which provides a diversion or permits people to amuse themselves."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001144> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Entertainment&oldid=1061851778"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001144> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
