<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Rotational Motion of an Object around an Axis of Rotation that passes through the Object's Center of Mass."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001184> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
