<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001190> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00002076> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Act of Telephone Calling"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Communication Mediated by Artifact in which sound is used to communicate over a telephone network to one or more recipients."@en .
