<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001624> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001753> "G" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001624> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
