<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001634> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GMT-1"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "CAT"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Central African Time"@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001634> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
