<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x supervises y =Def y is supervised by x."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001943> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/supervise" .
