<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001017> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x has accessory y =Def y accessory in x."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Accessory_(legal_term)" .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001949> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
