<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00002002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Media Content Entity that attests to certain demonstrated characteristics of an Object, Person, or Organization."@en .
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00002002> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "http://www.dictionary.com/browse/degree" .
